# Build context of validator/Dockerfile (context: repository root). Allowlist: only the files
# the Dockerfile COPYs are sent, so .env, certificates, SNOMED CT releases, IG packages and
# node_modules never reach the build. Add a line here when the Dockerfile COPYs a new file.
*
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!validator/advisor.json
!validator/docker-entrypoint.sh
!validator/nginx.conf
!validator/health.json
!docs/public/openapi.yaml
